    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/IMG_72481.PNG?t=1683354936\" /></div><br>The liber prologue tells us the backstory of Nick Rhodes' life in the wild west before the connection with a mysterious book that will completely turn his life upside down. You'll be part of a tense western with a gray morality where everyone is willing to trade friends and conscience for a coin and a bottle of whiskey. In this rugged world of the wild west you should learn just one rule.<br>He who does not know fear<br>God is not the judge<br>And the sheriff is not the law.<br>Waiting for you:<br>- Exploring the picturesque locations of the Wild Zakapa<br>- Stories and acquaintances with colorful characters<br>- One-on-one speed duels<br>- Shootouts, chases<br>- Riding a horse<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.poster.avif?t=1683354936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.webm?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.mp4?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.poster.avif?t=1683354936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.webm?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.mp4?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/IMG_72481.PNG?t=1683354936\" /></div><br>The liber prologue tells us the backstory of Nick Rhodes' life in the wild west before the connection with a mysterious book that will completely turn his life upside down. You'll be part of a tense western with a gray morality where everyone is willing to trade friends and conscience for a coin and a bottle of whiskey. In this rugged world of the wild west you should learn just one rule.<br>He who does not know fear<br>God is not the judge<br>And the sheriff is not the law.<br>Waiting for you:<br>- Exploring the picturesque locations of the Wild Zakapa<br>- Stories and acquaintances with colorful characters<br>- One-on-one speed duels<br>- Shootouts, chases<br>- Riding a horse<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.poster.avif?t=1683354936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.webm?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/617a9b2a7f5f39dbc79b823fc394eea0.mp4?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.poster.avif?t=1683354936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.webm?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163190/extras/5a78ae5527fa9caffa369c59e9698971.mp4?t=1683354936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
